      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK LES (3) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing third and beaten 1.3 lengths (16.80) behind Divot at this track. Sure to be about the mark. ODDLY COOL (2) goes very well this trip starting 11 times for six wins and four minors. Recorded a half a length win (19.42) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. FLASH OF GENIUS (8) is worth forgiving for his last effort when sixth (26.25) at Warragul over 460m. Cannot be taken lightly. TREBLE BEERS (4) deserves plenty of thought at his first run at this circuit.",
